      "problem_statement": "Build Station 3 (Spec Compiler) and Station 4 (Lowering Pass / Freeze Boundary) of the Phase 1 vertical slice. The Spec Compiler takes an IRSelection + original prompt and produces a WorkRequestGraph (a small DAG of work nodes). The Lowering Pass freezes this into an immutable ExecutionGraph by resolving handler references and computing the topological order. After lowering, the graph is hashable and modification is detectable.",
