      "problem_statement": "Build Station 5 of the Phase 1 vertical slice. The scheduler is a deterministic loop that walks a frozen ExecutionGraph in topological order, executes each node (simulated handler in v1), and emits CER events for each state transition (NODE_START, NODE_COMPLETE, NODE_FAIL, NODE_SKIP). The CER writer appends events to an append-only log with a hash chain (each event includes prev_event_hash). After append, events are never modified, deleted, or reordered.",
