      "problem_statement": "Build Station 6 of the Phase 1 vertical slice. The replay engine is a pure-function reducer that walks a CER event log and reconstructs the execution state (node_states, completed/failed nodes, overall completeness). It must be deterministic: same event log → same ExecutionState every time. It must also support partial replay: replay_until(log, event_index) to reconstruct state at any point.",
