      "problem_statement": "Stop writing plan markdown files to `IMPLEMENTATION_PLANS/` on every operation. The plans table in PostgreSQL is already authoritative; the filesystem mirror is conditional (guarded by `if (fs.existsSync(IMPL_DIR))`). Remove all file writes in plan creation, update, delete, promote, and revise operations. Then delete the `nexus/graph/IMPLEMENTATION_PLANS/` directory entirely. This eliminates ~200 lines of filesystem I/O across watcher.ts, tools.ts, and plan-watcher.ts.",
