      ],
      "problem_statement": "Extend WorkRequest from flat object to recursive DAG structure. Add EventEnvelope (tenant_id, trace_id, kernel_id), WorkRequest v1.1 (parent_request_id, declarative policy), WorkRequestNode (request + children + state + depth), WorkRequestDAG (root + nodes + edges + tenant_id + trace_id). Build 6-pass deterministic compilation pipeline: Pass 1 Normalize → Pass 2 Tenant Binding → Pass 3 DAG Construction → Pass 4 Structural Validation (cycle detection via DFS, orphan check, depth constraint) → Pass 5 Execution Compatibility → Pass 6 Policy Annotation. Derived from WRP_DAG_Planning_Guidance_harvested.md and Message Normalization & Trajectories.html.",
      "desired_outcome": "WRP v1.1 DAG Data Model & Compilation Pipeline",
