      "problem_statement": "Formalize the L1-L4 knowledge level ontology for Nebula: define the four abstraction levels (execution detail, subsystem design, architecture/rationale, doctrine/ontology), the ChunkKind enum (12 types: OVERVIEW, DEFINITION, PROTOCOL_RULE, DATA_MODEL, ALGORITHM, INVARIANT, MIGRATION_STEP, ACCEPTANCE_CRITERIA, OPEN_QUESTION, EXAMPLE, RATIONALE, IMPLEMENTATION_NOTE), NormativeStrength enum (INFORMATIVE, RECOMMENDED, REQUIRED, PROHIBITED), and the role→level retrieval mapping rules (Builder→L1 primary, Architect→L2/L3, etc.). This is the ontology layer that sits above the existing DDL infrastructure plans (#0161–#0163).",
