      "plan": "0181",
      "derived_from": [
        "0181"
      ],
      "problem_statement": "Implement temporal versioning for the WRP GraphState: MAIN (canonical), EXPERIMENTAL (testing), REPAIR (healing), SIMULATION (hypothetical) branches. A branch is a named, immutable pointer to a sequence of LOSMIR snapshots — not a copy of state. KernelState(branch, t) = Reduce(genesis → snapshot[t]). Branch graph is a DAG. MAIN is append-only linear history. Enables safe what-if analysis, repair workflows, and parallel semantic evolution without affecting production graph state.",
      "desired_outcome": "Nebula Temporal Graph Versioning and Branching Model",
      "produced_files": [
