      "abstraction_level": "system",
      "domain": "nexus",
      "plan": "1054",
      "derived_from": [
        "1054"
      ],
      "problem_statement": "The ccnf_bridge.py produces CCNF ExecutionReceipts (with CCNF hash, CER root hash, replay binding hash) but these are only written as filesystem artifacts. The bridge/sync.py syncs Conduit DB receipts to the WRP kernel but is unaware of CCNF execution receipts. This gap means CCNF verification results never flow into the kernel's audit chain. The goal is to wire CCNF ExecutionReceipts into the kernel delta pipeline as a new receipt type (e.g., CCNF_EXECUTION) that the kernel can validate and record.",
      "desired_outcome": "Connect CCNF ExecutionReceipts to the Kernel Bridge",
      "produced_files": [
        {
