        "1077"
      ],
      "problem_statement": "Implement the ExecutionTrace capture and ReplayEngine as the validation guardrail for the entire cognitive kernel. Every pipeline stage captures trace snapshots. The ReplayEngine re-runs historical traces against current/proposed architectures and verifies deterministic behavior via three-way hash comparison (CCNF, runtime, replay). This guarantees self-tuning does not introduce silent behavioral regressions.\n\nRequirements:\n- ExecutionTrace capture at each pipeline stage (DMM, PRC, GDBM, SICM, DAGoM, SDEPE)\n- SHA-256 hash chain for trace integrity\n- Sandboxed replay environment (not against live state)\n- Three-way hash comparison: CCNF (expected) vs Runtime (actual) vs Replay (reproduced)\n- Mismatches block TuningPatch application",
      "desired_outcome": "ExecutionTrace + ReplayEngine — Deterministic Validation Guardrail",
      "produced_files": [],
      "tags": [
        "plan-migration",
        "builder"
      ],
