        "1078"
      ],
      "problem_statement": "Implement the SICM (IdentityKernel) as the hard safety gate in the cognitive pipeline. SICM enforces non-negotiable system invariants — it validates every repair intent against a declared set of formal rules and rejects any intent that would violate them, regardless of budget availability.\n\nRequirements:\n- Sits after GDBM in pipeline: budget-gated intents → SICM invariant check → DAGoM timing check\n- Invariants declared as formal rules (CUE or TLA+ expressions)\n- Each invariant must have clear provenance (who, why, when)\n- Violations trigger alerts, not silent rejection\n- SICM must never be bypassable",
      "desired_outcome": "SICM — IdentityKernel for Invariant Enforcement",
