      ],
      "problem_statement": "Build the CCNF-bridge connecting the Conduit WorkRequest pipeline to the ccnf-ref verifier implementation. Provides the observability data layer that feeds DMM's sensors — capturing execution traces, pipeline states, and component health signals.\n\nRequirements:\n- Run as middleware within conduit-mcp process\n- Capture WorkRequest lifecycle events, pipeline state transitions, component heartbeats\n- Publish ExecutionTrace snapshots at each pipeline stage\n- Must be non-blocking (no pipeline throughput degradation)",
      "desired_outcome": "CCNF-Bridge — Conduit-to-CCNF Observability Integration",
