      "problem_statement": "Implement the GapCompiler (PRC) that converts DMM divergence signals into actionable, low-risk WorkRequests. Translates detected systemic gaps into structured repair intents enriched with context (affected component, severity, suggested fix strategy), emitted through conduit-mcp's WorkRequest pipeline.\n\nRequirements:\n- Accept DMM DivergenceSignal outputs as input\n- Map each gap to a WorkRequest with component, severity, strategy, priority\n- Deduplicate recurring gaps via gap signature tracking\n- Integrate with conduit-mcp WorkRequest emission API",
