      "problem_statement": "Three tables exist in the tackle PostgreSQL schema so that prompts, task assignments, and role-to-MCP-tool access can be expressed as durable, FK-validated, default-deny database state: tackle.prompts (reusable versioned prompt templates, one row per role/slug/version), tackle.tasks (concrete task assignments, FK prompt_id to tackle.prompts.id, binds role/task_slug/scope/acceptance_criteria/prompt_id), and tackle.role_tool_access (per-tool-slug positive allowlist with mcp_id rollup, UNIQUE(role, tool_slug), default-deny for unlisted roles). Schema-only portion of Architect decision d708c452; steps 4-6 are follow-ups.",
