      "plan_number": "0142",
      "title": "Replay engine (P1-5) [revised]",
      "status": "archived",
      "goal": "Station 6 of Phase 1: pure-function reducer that walks a CER event log and reconstructs ExecutionState. Deterministic, supports partial replay via replay_until(). Already implemented and tested (18 tests pass). Revision to clear REVIEW_REJECT from Temporal infra failure.",
