      "title": "WRP v1.0 Protocol Formalization — Schema, Events, State Machine, API",
      "status": "draft",
      "goal": "Formalize the WorkRequest protocol as a typed event-sourced protocol. Define: versioned JSON schema for WorkRequest ($id, schema versioning), base event contract (event_id, wrp_id, type, timestamp, version, causation_id, correlation_id), 11-state state machine (CREATED→INTAKE→PLANNING→CRITIQUE→SPECIFICATION→APPROVED→QUEUED→EXECUTING→COMPLETED→ARCHIVED + FAILED from any active state), 4 API endpoints (create WorkRequest, emit event, get state, replay), and 3-level versioning (protocol, event, WorkRequest). Derived from semantic-ir-wrp-harvested.md.",
