    {
      "plan_number": "0166",
      "title": "WRP v1.2 Execution Traversal Engine with Hierarchical Receipts",
      "status": "archived",
      "goal": "Build the runtime traversal engine for the WRP DAG: ExecutionContext (immutable during traversal — tenant_id, trace_id, strategy, kernel, mode), 3 traversal strategies (DFS default, BFS parallelizable, Topological strict DAG), Hierarchical ExecutionReceipt (node_id, tenant_id, trace_id, result, children[], status — tree not flat log), Recursive Boundary Rule (child WorkRequests enter PendingExecutionQueue, NOT auto-executed), probabilistic policies only active in experimental mode. Dispatch recursion: child FAILED → parent BLOCKED, parent advances only when dependencies satisfied, parent CRITIQUE triggers CRITIQUE on all children.",
      "files_count": 3,
      "acceptance_count": 26,
      "dependencies": [
        "\"[\\\"0164\\\"]\""
