      "title": "WRP Migration Plan — 4-Phase Rollout from Flat to DAG-Based Runtime",
      "status": "archived",
      "goal": "Execute 4-phase rollout from current flat WRP to DAG-compliant runtime. Phase 1: New conduit-wrp package with shadow event emitters — NO behavior change, dual-write WRP events alongside legacy state transitions. Phase 2: Dual-write validation — both legacy and WRP transitions validated, WRP events persisted, cross-system consistency check (Spring emits, Python kernel executes, DB stores, Nexus visualizes). Phase 3: WRP events become the execution driver — kernel becomes reactive subscriber. Phase 4: Legacy state machines removed, shell becomes event router only. Derived from semantic-ir-wrp-harvested.md [Agreed] WRP Migration Plan.",
