      "goal": "Implement the review state machine for Nebula corpus items: lifecycle axis (DRAFT→ACTIVE→SUPERSEDED), review axis (UNREVIEWED, NEEDS_REVIEW, UNDER_REVIEW, REVIEWED, CURRENT_FOCUS, OUTDATED, QUESTIONED, SUPERSEDED_CONFIRMED), 8 attention reasons (BLOCKING_IMPLEMENTATION, OUT_OF_DATE_WITH_RUNTIME, etc.), 4 priorities (CRITICAL→LOW), ReviewAnnotation nodes, and the JSON-LD schema (nebula-review-state.jsonld). Review state is orthogonal to lifecycle — items can be ACTIVE but QUESTIONED, SUPERSEDED but CURRENT_FOCUS.",
      "files_count": 1,
      "acceptance_count": 1,
      "dependencies": [
        "\"[\\\"0173\\\"]\""
      ],
      "tags": [],
      "created_at": "2026-06-22 03:55:48+00",
      "updated_at": "2026-06-27 01:26:43+00",
      "_src": "db"
    },
    {
      "plan_number": "0177",
      "title": "WRP Document Projection Pipeline — Markdown to Nebula Graph Compiler",
      "status": "archived",
      "goal": "Build the pipeline that compiles WRP markdown documents into the Nebula knowledge graph: Docling HTML→markdown conversion, LangChain RecursiveCharacterTextSplitter chunking at 40k/4k overlap, chunk kind classification, level assignment, cross-reference extraction, and INSERT into nebula_documents + nebula_chunks tables. Formalize the SpecificationAgenda extraction schema used during harvest.",
